WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.459 --> 00:00:03.109
- [Chinedu] We're
dramatically disadvantaged

00:00:03.109 --> 00:00:06.296
as a country because of
the impact of traffic.

00:00:06.296 --> 00:00:09.747
The average Nigerian spends
hours every day in traffic.

00:00:09.747 --> 00:00:11.477
We just don't have the infrastructure

00:00:11.477 --> 00:00:14.958
to support the amount
of people in this city.

00:00:14.958 --> 00:00:17.541
(upbeat music)

00:00:27.842 --> 00:00:29.302
- [Narrator] Here in Lagos, Nigeria,

00:00:29.302 --> 00:00:32.324
traffic can get, well, pretty bad.

00:00:32.324 --> 00:00:35.764
So two friends had
enough of waiting around.

00:00:35.764 --> 00:00:37.324
They had a plan.

00:00:37.324 --> 00:00:38.843
- I'm Adetayo Bamiduro.

00:00:38.843 --> 00:00:40.593
- And I'm Chinedu Azodoh.

00:00:40.593 --> 00:00:43.844
- And we're co-founders of Max.NG.

00:00:43.844 --> 00:00:45.161
- Max is a mobile app

00:00:45.161 --> 00:00:47.683
that provides Africans access to

00:00:47.683 --> 00:00:49.502
motorcycle taxis in real time.

00:00:49.502 --> 00:00:52.585
- And what we do is we train drivers,

00:00:53.844 --> 00:00:54.677
um, regulates them,

00:00:54.677 --> 00:00:56.401
and then connect them to customers

00:00:56.401 --> 00:00:58.998
who need to move from
one point to the other.

00:00:58.998 --> 00:01:00.279
We also connect those drivers

00:01:00.279 --> 00:01:02.041
to individuals on business days

00:01:02.041 --> 00:01:04.493
who have packages they want to deliver

00:01:04.493 --> 00:01:06.493
from point A to point B.

00:01:09.410 --> 00:01:10.728
- [Narrator] Chinedu and Adetayo met

00:01:10.728 --> 00:01:12.479
while studying in the States.

00:01:12.479 --> 00:01:13.975
They took a few classes together,

00:01:13.975 --> 00:01:16.838
and both realized they wanted
to help their home country.

00:01:16.838 --> 00:01:17.879
- While we were there,

00:01:17.879 --> 00:01:21.109
we both had the passion to
transform and to change Africa.

00:01:21.109 --> 00:01:22.457
We asked ourselves, you know,

00:01:22.457 --> 00:01:24.877
what is the best way for
us to create a lot of jobs,

00:01:24.877 --> 00:01:26.746
and what kind of problem can we solve

00:01:26.746 --> 00:01:29.563
that would that would
make a lot of impact?

00:01:29.563 --> 00:01:30.396
- [Chinedu] You see, Nigeria is

00:01:30.396 --> 00:01:31.854
one of the fastest growing countries

00:01:31.854 --> 00:01:33.524
from a population standpoint.

00:01:33.524 --> 00:01:35.690
With the infrastructure that
we have available today,

00:01:35.690 --> 00:01:37.549
motorcycles solve the problem.

00:01:37.549 --> 00:01:39.220
You see, everything else
gets stuck in traffic.

00:01:39.220 --> 00:01:41.268
A car gets stuck in traffic.

00:01:41.268 --> 00:01:43.329
Buses get stuck in traffic.

00:01:43.329 --> 00:01:44.970
- [Narrator] The motorcycles
allow their drivers to dart

00:01:44.970 --> 00:01:46.469
in and out traffic easily,

00:01:46.469 --> 00:01:49.729
thus saving time and being
able to make more deliveries.

00:01:49.729 --> 00:01:53.410
So far, the company has
hired over 500 people,

00:01:53.410 --> 00:01:56.711
and changed the lives of
many Nigerian families.

00:01:56.711 --> 00:01:58.319
Chinedu and Adetayo
see it as their mission

00:01:58.319 --> 00:01:59.770
to make a change in Lagos,

00:01:59.770 --> 00:02:01.199
and the rest of Africa.

00:02:01.199 --> 00:02:02.250
According to Max,

00:02:02.250 --> 00:02:04.980
their drivers make two and a
half the industry average—

00:02:04.980 --> 00:02:08.940
a wage that can set them on
a path to financial success.

00:02:08.940 --> 00:02:10.159
- I am a Max champion.

00:02:10.159 --> 00:02:11.660
- I am a Max champion!

00:02:11.660 --> 00:02:14.799
- What we can do to make
life better for everybody,

00:02:14.799 --> 00:02:18.232
we do that to the best of our abilities.

00:02:18.232 --> 00:02:20.482
(laughter)

